<title>POLAND: Banks bid for PLN 278.5 mln at NBP-bill tender.</title>
<headline>Banks bid for PLN 278.5 mln at NBP-bill tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish money market dealers bid to buy 278.5 million zlotys worth of the National Bank of Poland's 91-day bills at Thursday's 300 million zloty tender, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Full details of the tender should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
